# Report Quality Requirements

All metrics must come from:

* Actual assets
* Actual CBOM data
* Actual certificates
* Actual keys
* Actual telemetry
* Actual trust relationships
* Actual compliance mappings
* Actual migration jobs

Never use:

* Fake data
* Placeholder values
* Hardcoded metrics

If evidence is unavailable:

Display:

Evidence Not Available

instead of assumptions.

